    "%lld 行 · %@ · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$lld 行 · %2$@ · %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘S 保存最后聚焦的编辑侧；⇧⌘S 另存为。文件菜单提供全部保存、重新加载与编码操作。关闭或退出前会询问未保存修改。未保存内容在停止编辑约 1 秒后保存为本地草稿，下次启动可选择恢复。突然断电前尚未写入的内容可能无法恢复。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘S saves the last focused editor; ⇧⌘S saves it as a new file. The File menu offers Save All, Reload, and encoding options. Closing or quitting prompts about unsaved changes. Unsaved content is saved locally about one second after editing stops and can be recovered on the next launch. Changes not yet written before power loss may not be recoverable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘S 保存最后聚焦的编辑侧；⇧⌘S 另存为。文件菜单提供全部保存、重新加载与编码操作。关闭或退出前会询问未保存修改。未保存内容在停止编辑约 1 秒后保存为本地草稿，下次启动可选择恢复。突然断电前尚未写入的内容可能无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diflo" : {

    },
    "Diflo 使用帮助" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diflo Help"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diflo 使用帮助"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diflo 在本地读取、比较和编辑你选择的文件。当前版本没有账号、广告、跟踪或将文件上传到服务器的功能。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diflo reads, compares, and edits selected files locally. This version has no accounts, advertising, tracking, or file uploads to a server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diflo 在本地读取、比较和编辑你选择的文件。当前版本没有账号、广告、跟踪或将文件上传到服务器的功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
