    "丢弃全部修改" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Discard All Changes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "丢弃全部修改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为恢复工作，应用会在沙盒的 Application Support/Diflo 目录保存未保存的左右文本、文件位置和授权书签、编码、比较选项及光标位置。草稿包含你输入的内容，请按文件本身的敏感程度管理。最近对比最多记录 20 组文件位置和授权书签，不保存正文；编辑偏好保存在应用自己的设置中。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To recover work, the app stores unsaved text from both sides, file locations and access bookmarks, encoding, comparison options, and cursor positions in Application Support/Diflo inside its sandbox. Drafts contain your text and should be treated as sensitively as the original files. Recent history stores up to 20 file pairs and access bookmarks without document contents. Editor preferences are stored in the app's own settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为恢复工作，应用会在沙盒的 Application Support/Diflo 目录保存未保存的左右文本、文件位置和授权书签、编码、比较选项及光标位置。草稿包含你输入的内容，请按文件本身的敏感程度管理。最近对比最多记录 20 组文件位置和授权书签，不保存正文；编辑偏好保存在应用自己的设置中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交换两侧" : {

    },
    "体验示例" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Try Sample"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体验示例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 ⌘↑ / ⌘↓ 跳转差异，点击中央箭头采纳一侧内容。末尾换行也是独立差异。粗略比较可能扩大合并范围，请先检查目标内容；⌘Z 可撤销。忽略规则只影响比较，不会修改文件。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use ⌘↑ / ⌘↓ to navigate differences and the center arrows to accept content from either side. Final newlines are separate differences. Coarse comparisons may merge larger ranges; review the target first. Use ⌘Z to undo. Ignore rules affect comparisons without editing files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 ⌘↑ / ⌘↓ 跳转差异，点击中央箭头采纳一侧内容。末尾换行也是独立差异。粗略比较可能扩大合并范围，请先检查目标内容；⌘Z 可撤销。忽略规则只影响比较，不会修改文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
