    "普通粘贴保留原文；⌥⇧⌘V 明确格式化后粘贴。⌘F 查找；⌘L 跳转到行；⌘+ / ⌘− 缩放字号。设置中可调整字号、Tab 宽度、自动换行和空白显示；比较菜单可将当前侧设为只读。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ordinary paste preserves the original text; ⌥⇧⌘V explicitly formats it. Use ⌘F to find, ⌘L to go to a line, and ⌘+ / ⌘− to change text size. Settings control text size, tab width, wrapping, and whitespace. The Compare menu can make the current side read-only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "普通粘贴保留原文；⌥⇧⌘V 明确格式化后粘贴。⌘F 查找；⌘L 跳转到行；⌘+ / ⌘− 缩放字号。设置中可调整字号、Tab 宽度、自动换行和空白显示；比较菜单可将当前侧设为只读。"
          }
        }
