    },
    "首页可单独删除草稿、移除或清空最近记录。关闭对比时明确丢弃，或保存后结束对比，都会删除对应草稿。下方操作仅清除未被窗口使用的恢复草稿与最近记录，当前窗口内容保留。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the start screen, delete drafts individually or remove and clear recent history. Explicitly discarding a comparison or closing it after saving removes its draft. The action below clears only recovery drafts not in use by a window and recent history. Current window contents remain available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "首页可单独删除草稿、移除或清空最近记录。关闭对比时明确丢弃，或保存后结束对比，都会删除对应草稿。下方操作仅清除未被窗口使用的恢复草稿与最近记录，当前窗口内容保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
